<title>USA: Carlisle completes Hartstone acquisition.</title>
<headline>Carlisle completes Hartstone acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlisle Cos Inc said Friday it completed the acquisition of Hartstone Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hartstone is a leading designer and manufacturer of ceramic tableware, cookware and decorative kitchenware.</p>
<p>Carlisle is a diversified manufacturer of construction materials, transportation products and general industrial products.</p>
